Z||000050||DaRkLoRD||11-16-1999||03:59 PM||||agreed, if it's been 6 months already, tell us who it is..<P>at the very least we can get him off the forum, as well as over 500 members emailing him.... and remember, it's not spam.. just nice friendly emails suggesting he pay, or we'll keep sending him polite reminders...<P>or maybe not, I don't want to be accused as a spammer, or someone advocating that.<P>Actually, in the past 3 years of my business. I've been cheated out of about $2,500... $200 from a business partnership in which a loan was never paid off, and $2,300 in payments from a web site I created for a large real estate agency in Florida. That was for 10 months of work too, so I thought it was fairly reasonable. Guess not, they fired me and didn't pay a cent.<P>So I know how it feels to get burned like this.||||reg||1
